<title>USA: 1Superconductor Technologies offering priced.</title>
<headline>1Superconductor Technologies offering priced.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA BARBARA, Calif. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Superconductor Technologies Inc Friday said a public offering of 1.5 million shares of its common stock has been priced at $3.75 per share.</p>
<p>The company said it granted to the underwriter of the offering an option to purchase up to an additional 225,000 shares solely to cover over-allotments, of which 125,000 have been allocated to a selling stockholder.</p>
<p>Superconductor Technologies designs and manufactures subsystems for high-performance wireless applications.</p>
